== Trivia ==
* The trinket might be a reference to [http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-860 SCP-860], a fictional key that acts in a near-identical manner.
* If used on the {{s|???}} floor, one might hear the mid-combat layer of the floor's theme, Nativitate, an asset which was previously unused.
** The combat layer of ''Nativitate'' can also be heard in a {{r|Crawl Space}} or an {{r|I AM ERROR}} room with enemies, or in rooms created by {{i|Red Key}} (or similar effects) on the ??? floor.
* This is the only trinket to be unlocked by defeating {{E|The Beast}}.

